1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives a magicless boy named Asta.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
This brave young hero devotes blood, sweat, and tears

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
to becoming the next wizard king.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Though Asta's situation is practically unheard of,

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
there are others residing in this kingdom

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
who possess at least a tiny amount of mana,

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
yet can barely use spells at all.

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
They make up a very small minority,

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
living their lives in the shadows.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
But, like everyone else,

13
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
they do their best to survive.

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Where am I?

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
What am I doing here?

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Wait, I remember!

17
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
You're finally awake.

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
It's you.

19
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
You're friends with Asta and my brother.

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Yes.

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Our magic's been sealed, so we can't escape.

22
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
And I borrowed a tracking device from Asta,

23
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
but they took that too.

24
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Who kidnapped us?

25
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Do you know these people?

26
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Mm-mm.

27
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
The only thing this girl and I have in common

28
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
is that we were accused of working with the devil.

29
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
They're probably planning to use us for leverage somehow.

30
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,000
This is all for the sake of justice.

31
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Yes indeed, Master Cobwe.

32
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,000
It's our responsibility to rid this kingdom of the devil's evil servants

33
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
and to rebuild what they destroyed.

34
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
It shall be done at all costs.

35
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000
So,

36
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:52,000
何度も 何度も 何度も 目の前の今を超えるさ

37
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,000
何度も 何度も 何度も 涙を希望に変えていこう

38
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:05,000
七色の 日常を進め 永遠に光れ

39
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
シャインラインカテモン

40
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:21,000
天使と 悪魔が 交際してく

41
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:27,000
世界は 宇宙だらけさ

42
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
思い通りじゃない

43
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:37,000
そのくらいで 明ける夢はダサい

44
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
そう 何度も 何度も 何度も 夢の前の

45
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
壁を超えるさ

46
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:51,000
何度も 何度も 良さを未来に繋げよう

47
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:58,000
七色の 日常を進め 永遠に光れ

48
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
You shine like a diamond

49
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
You shine like a diamond

50
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
There are so many people...

51
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Our kingdom deserves justice and the devil banishers are going to make sure we get it!

52
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Kill those traitors now!

53
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Just get on with it!

54
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,000
We wanna see blood!

55
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
I can't wait for the show!

56
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Asserts them right!

57
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:42,000
This is insane!

58
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,000
They'll all die for disrespecting my angel!

59
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:48,000
They sure are amped up about watching a couple of girls die!

60
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
This is so terrifying!

61
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Yeah!

62
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Hang in there you two!

63
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
The black bulls are coming to the rescue!

64
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Listen up everyone!

65
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,000
We got a message from Julius on the way!

66
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:02,000
It looks like all squads are in position!

67
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,000
The execution's scheduled for noon so we've only got a little while left to wait!

68
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:13,000
We don't know their numbers but I'm sure they'll be using a combination of spells and various drugs!

69
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Though this mission may prove difficult, I'll trust you'll do everything you can to recover the captives!

70
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:27,000
The Silver Eagles and the Crimson Lion Kings will assist with the rescue and make sure that none of the civilians in the crowd are harmed in the process!

71
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:32,000
The Blue Rose Knights and Green Praying Mantises will patrol the square at all times!

72
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:38,000
And given their closeness to the situation, the Black Bulls will be the main squad in charge of saving the hostages!

73
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Sounds good!

74
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:44,000
One thing though, there's a certain someone over here who's got nothing to do with the mission whatsoever!

75
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,000
I'm guessing he tagged along out of guilt seeing as how his subordinates are probably behind this whole mess!

76
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:55,000
But I think it's gonna be bad news if he decides to act on his own!

77
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,000
This rescue is top priority!

78
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,000
Can we trust you'll go along with our operation, Dom Natio?

79
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Yes, that is my intention, sir, but I need to confirm something first!

80
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:13,000
If Asta uses the Devil's power in front of this large crowd, then it will only create more anger and confusion!

81
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
So I'm asking...

82
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Of course he's not gonna do it!

83
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Did you think we'd be that stupid?

84
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:23,000
Alright squad, everyone but Ghosh and the Kid keep an eye on the square like we discussed!

85
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,000
These girls are two of our own, so don't screw up!

86
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Right!

87
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,000
Good luck!

88
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Be safe!

89
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:34,000
The other squads are watching over the Noble Realm, as you requested!

90
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,000
Right!

91
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:40,000
We have to keep in mind that the execution could be a ruse to distract us while they cause trouble elsewhere!

92
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:43,000
We'd better make sure we put a stop to their plans!

93
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:47,000
If they carry this out, it'll throw the Kingdom into an even greater panic!

94
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Yes, it's up to the Magic Knights!

95
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:55,000
We haven't seen anything unusual yet!

96
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
I hope the rescue mission goes smoothly!

97
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:04,000
With Captain Vongence away protecting the border, we can't contribute much to the main part of the plan, but let's be on alert!

98
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Right!

99
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Why do we have to patrol?

100
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:11,000
You're the best fighter, you should be right in the middle of the action!

101
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,000
The plan's been made, that's that!

102
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
Hey, wait for me, you know!

103
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
It's almost time!

104
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
The purveyors of justice will soon arrive!

105
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
Forget the Magic Knights and the Magic Parliament!

106
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Only the Devil Banishers can set this Kingdom right!

107
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
I agree!

108
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
Someone must uphold the law!

109
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:37,000
I bet those guys are in the crowd somewhere!

110
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,000
How are we going to find them?

111
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Man, these people have lost it!

112
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,000
Makes me wonder if they've all been drugged too!

113
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:58,000
I can't stand this!

114
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Look, Captain, you've gotta let me go down there!

115
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,000
Oh, can I come with you?

116
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Right down!

117
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:07,000
If you go waltzing in there, you'll blow the lid off this whole plan!

118
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Okay, but we can't just do nothing!

119
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,000
You're the ace in the hole, kid!

120
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:14,000
We need to wait for our moment!

121
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Right.

122
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,000
We still haven't seen any sign of them yet.

123
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Odd.

124
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,000
It's noon now.

125
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Where are they?

126
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:35,000
I gotta say, I'm not really seeing anyone who looks suspicious.

127
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Stay on guard.

128
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Will do, shark.

129
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Okay!

130
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,000
They're not even here on time!

131
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Hey, witch!

132
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:46,000
If you want your friends to survive, then you'll do as we say.

133
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:52,000
You make one wrong move, and we'll kill the hostages before they even get out in front of the crowd.

134
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Start walking slowly toward the exit.

135
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:00,000
I knew I wouldn't sense their mana, but I didn't expect them to approach me like this.

136
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,000
It's all right.

137
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
I'm sure the others can pull it off without me.

138
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Understood.

139
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
And there they are.

140
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Greetings, enemies of the Devil!

141
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:22,000
The time has come to strike in the name of righteousness!

142
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,000
We are the Devil Banishers!

143
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:31,000
Those who wish for the Devil's demise!

144
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Settledale.

145
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:44,000
Now I can understand how they were able to conceal their mana so completely.

146
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Except that it looks like only those three are wearing them.

147
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,000
The evidence of this woman's guilt is obvious!

148
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Notice the pair of horns on her head!

149
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Proof that she worked with the Devil and used forbidden magic!

150
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
How disgusting!

151
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
That girl's evil incarnate!

152
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:07,000
The child Dexter, whose brother is a former criminal, is also the Devil's servant!

153
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:11,000
We have undeniable proof that their actions have destroyed countless lives!

154
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
How could anyone condemn that sweet little face?

155
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,000
Kill them both now!

156
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,000
They should have been put to death a long time ago!

157
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Lord Damnatio, if that barrier spell explodes, it's going to harm a large number of civilians.

158
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Kabwe, I understand that you seek justice, but how can you expect the innocent to pay the price for it?

159
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:36,000
That magic, since it's a barrier, I'm guessing one of Scaleboy's lackeys is responsible.

160
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
But we mustn't forget!

161
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:43,000
There's one boy who was possessed by the Devil himself, and we hate him most of all!

162
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,000
That traitor's name...

163
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,000
Is Asta!

164
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Every drop of blood spilled by the eye of the midnight sun is on his hands!

165
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:57,000
We know that you're here with us, Asta!

166
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:01,000
And we want nothing more than to see you dead!

167
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,000
It's just like Captain Yami said...

168
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Even if Asta took the blame for that, they still wouldn't stop this!

169
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:15,000
However, if you come forward immediately and plead guilty, we will allow your two companions to walk free!

170
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Hero... free!

171
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Why haven't you responded?

172
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,000
It must mean that you value your own life over those of your cohorts!

173
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,000
Of course he does!

174
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,000
That's what a Devil would do!

175
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,000
Asta would never abandon his friends!

176
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:42,000
Very well. We have our answer.

177
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,000
I'm over here!

178
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Good. Now approach the stage.

179
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:03,000
I don't see Vanessa, but there's no time to track her down now.

180
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,000
You little freak!

181
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:08,000
That's him, everyone! He's the villain who destroyed our kingdom!

182
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
You murdered my entire family!

183
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
Kill him!

184
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,000
Serves him right!

185
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,000
Look, I swear! We don't work with the Devil!

186
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Shut your mouth, demon!

187
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,000
Stop right there.

188
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,000
We'll be confiscating your grimoire as well.

189
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,000
What, did that ruin your plans?

190
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:40,000
We know that you intended to use anti-magic to cancel out the barrier we've set up around the square.

191
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Come on! Execute him already!

192
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,000
If I take the blame, then you'll let them go?

193
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,000
Well, yes, that is what I just said.

194
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Then step away from them!

195
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,000
And put down your swords!

196
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Certainly.

197
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
Now then, hand over your grimoire.

198
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Okay.

199
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,000
Okay.

200
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Hmm?

201
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,000
No!

202
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,000
What?

203
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,000
Too off the...

204
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:11,000
All we needed was for you to look away from the hostages for a couple of seconds.

205
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Dark magic.

206
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,000
Dark clothes.

207
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Lightless.

208
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Run!

209
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,000
They're so much so much pain in me!

210
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
Ahhhhh!

211
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Your sleeping potions won't work this time!

212
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,000
Paper magic.

213
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Dagger folding.

214
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,000
Early summer rain!

215
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Hurry!

216
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Now's your chance!

217
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Nice cry.

218
00:12:45,000 --> 00:13:02,480
You ready? Let's go.

219
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:05,960
Okay, now it's getting interesting.

220
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,640
Run!

221
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,260
The others are buying some time.

222
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:16,620
Transparency magic. Share the same fate.

223
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:24,560
Mero! Marie! Come back!

224
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,520
Move it! Get away!

225
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:28,220
Hey, kid, where are you?

226
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,800
A truck? Water magic!

227
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,460
Sea dragon's lair!

228
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:47,360
Something's wrong. I can't control it.

229
00:13:47,540 --> 00:13:49,840
Do something! It's gonna close and it's glitched me!

230
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:53,620
What happened? And why don't you have Marie?

231
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,100
Asta went after her.

232
00:13:55,640 --> 00:14:00,740
I'm sorry, I was gonna go too, but the smoke's affecting my eyesight and I can't really use my magic.

233
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:03,900
The traps that I set up around the square aren't responding.

234
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:07,920
Not sure what, but there's something in that smoke that messes with mana.

235
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,440
If that's how they want to play, fine.

236
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:18,680
That's what I'm talking about, Captain Yami. Way to teach him a lesson, huh?

237
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:27,480
Now, help all the civilians evacuate.

238
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:31,980
Fall to your knees.

239
00:14:31,980 --> 00:15:01,960
Fall to your knees.

240
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,980
Thank you for tons of force of fate, so all we were trying to do was to get you away from the square.

241
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:09,480
I see. Except, even without altering fate.

242
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:12,940
I already know that my friends have set the two hostages free.

243
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:17,340
Which means I don't have to cooperate with you.

244
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,620
We know we can't beat a magic knight.

245
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:22,760
We also know you read the memories of those you capture.

246
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:25,480
In other words, our job is done.

247
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:29,700
We went into this operation completely prepared to sacrifice ourselves.

248
00:15:43,860 --> 00:15:46,280
They just took their own lives like it was nothing.

249
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:51,080
I don't know what their plan is, but how could it have been that important to them?

250
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:55,380
I feel their key. They must be close.

251
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,740
It's all over.

252
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:05,940
Chasing us down without thinking is exactly what we wanted you to do.

253
00:16:06,620 --> 00:16:09,620
Huh, fool. Time to surrender the grimoire.

254
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:13,240
And don't resist, or we'll exterminate your friends.

255
00:16:14,300 --> 00:16:14,780
Master!

256
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:18,180
Don't worry! We'll get out of this!

257
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:23,260
I'd like to see you try that without using the Devil's power.

258
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:41,680
