270
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:24,940
If you do, they'll just hit the girl!

271
00:17:25,740 --> 00:17:28,740
Paper magic! Dagger folding early summer rain!

272
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:35,820
What's happening?

273
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:41,200
This must be them. The Devil Banishers.

274
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,560
You know? Where'd you come from?

275
00:17:44,700 --> 00:17:49,200
Oh, we were just in the neighborhood, so we figured we would drop by. That's no biggie.

276
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,640
We were only supposed to be patrolling.

277
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:55,760
