278
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,300
Asta! I hope you're not injured!

279
00:17:58,300 --> 00:18:00,560
I'm fine! Just help Nero!

280
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:02,240
You'll pay for this!

281
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:14,020
If they hadn't shown up, we would have had Asta for sure!

282
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:16,980
We need to retreat before they catch us!

283
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:25,620
Give Nero back!

284
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:29,100
That's not going to happen! Now stand down, or we'll slit her throat!

285
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,880
Really? They're running away?

286
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:33,660
Unbelievable.

287
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:43,860
They say that a Devil dwells in the Five-Leaf Grimoire.

288
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:46,460
