321
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,960
She's just sleeping.

322
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:07,620
Owen says she needs rest, but she'll wake up later on.

323
00:20:07,620 --> 00:20:09,440
So, she's gonna be okay?

324
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:10,120
Yes.

325
00:20:12,120 --> 00:20:12,680
Good.

326
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:17,520
I guess this means that I owe you again.

327
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:25,620
Today we discovered that my subordinates were indeed responsible for the kidnappings.

328
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,900
Please allow me to apologize for my oversight.

329
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,580
You said they had a strong sense of justice.

330
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:36,100
